cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or this pipeline in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Animalia Dataset Generator: a DEB-based pipeline for life cycle modelling and biological NER corpus generation"
abstract: >-
  A two-stage pipeline for extracting, classifying and structuring biological
  data from the Add-my-Pet (AmP) collection, covering 7,332 animal species.
  It produces normalized per-species DEB parameter files, life cycle timeline
  diagrams and narrative descriptions for 54 taxonomic classes across 10 DEB
  models, a biological lexicon of stage and transition synonyms, generated
  annotation texts, and a BIO-tagged named entity recognition corpus.
type: dataset
